==== TFTP ====

When powered with the reset button held down, it attempts to download "firmware.ram" from a TFTP server at 192.168.11.2 and sets its IP to 192.168.11.1. Timeout is set to "10". After a timeout, the router continues to boot linux. If the reset button continues to be held down, the device resets once the busybox "press enter for prompt" is displayed.

